{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Residue of The Lost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Some souls do not vanish\u2026 they just linger.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Residue of The Lost is not just a game that scares you\u2014it is a psychological horror experience that drags you into the shadows of the human soul and the thin line between magic and belief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\ude78 Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The echoes of ancient curses still resonate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sorcerer, in his quest for immortality, binds the \u201cSoul Body\u201d to the world \u2014 and everything begins from there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a sorcerer reincarnated in the modern world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you uncover the dark rituals of the past, you will release not only the cursed soul but also your own deepest fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Every curse demands a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every spell chains a soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udd2e Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric story inspired by real rituals and magical symbols</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic curse system that reacts to player choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A parallel timeline between 15th\u201317th century Europe and the modern world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>What the Lost Are Saying</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; \u201cScents, whispers, and shadows\u2026 one of the rare games that makes you feel fear physically.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIn this game, it\u2019s not just the souls that get lost\u2014you do too.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>If You Dare\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soul beneath the ashes awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the magic begins, there\u2019s no turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Residue of The Lost \u2013 Where the lost never rest.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4138220?t=1762221997","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138220/a82891d50f6123de6882a935b59e7618ea6d37c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762221997","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138220/297c0ed1bbe6d1866e4341d6c101bb2292d24859/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762221997","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138220/297c0ed1bbe6d1866e4341d6c101bb2292d24859/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762221997","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Residue of The Lost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Some souls do not vanish\u2026 they just linger.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Residue of The Lost is not just a game that scares you\u2014it is a psychological horror experience that drags you into the shadows of the human soul and the thin line between magic and belief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\ude78 Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The echoes of ancient curses still resonate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sorcerer, in his quest for immortality, binds the \u201cSoul Body\u201d to the world \u2014 and everything begins from there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a sorcerer reincarnated in the modern world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you uncover the dark rituals of the past, you will release not only the cursed soul but also your own deepest fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Every curse demands a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every spell chains a soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udd2e Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric story inspired by real rituals and magical symbols</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic curse system that reacts to player choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A parallel timeline between 15th\u201317th century Europe and the modern world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>What the Lost Are Saying</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; \u201cScents, whispers, and shadows\u2026 one of the rare games that makes you feel fear physically.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIn this game, it\u2019s not just the souls that get lost\u2014you do too.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>If You Dare\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soul beneath the ashes awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the magic begins, there\u2019s no turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_para